## Project memory

Local Agent provides relevant background notes for substantive tasks. Use the notes as reference and validate their facts against the workspace. Leave the Obsidian vault unchanged. The application maintains the checkpoint after the turn. Report changed files, commands run, observable results, errors and pending work in the final response.
